    "label": "14",
    "prompt": "A piece of machinery has an initial value of $\\$25\\,000$. Due to usage and age, its value depreciated by $8\\%$ each year. Find the value of the piece of machinery after the following periods. Give numerical monetary answers to the nearest cent; give part d as an exact expression.",
